420 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Poor work-life balance, stemming from overwork and inability to disconnect, negatively impacts employees' mental health. It leads to burnout, stress, and decreased well-being. Encouraging boundaries, flexible schedules, and time off can mitigate these effects, fostering healthier work environments and enhancing overall employee mental health.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
