425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Job insecurity breeds anxiety and stress among employees, impacting mental health adversely. Fear of layoffs or organizational changes creates uncertainty about the future, leading to decreased job satisfaction and morale. Employers can mitigate these effects by providing transparent communication, offering support and resources for career development, and fostering a sense of stability and trust within the organization.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
