<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 250 0 R
/Pg 18 0 R
>>
endobj
427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (4\) Bullying and Harassment: )
/E (4\) Bullying and Harassment: )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Bullying and harassment in the workplace have severe implications for employees' mental health. Enduring such toxic behavior can lead to anxiety, depression, and feelings of isolation. It erodes confidence and self-esteem, affecting job performance and overall well-being. Employers must enforce strict anti-bullying policies, provide training on respectful behavior, and foster a culture of mutual respect and inclusion to safeguard employees' mental health.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
429 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 250 0 R
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
