<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (5\) Lack of Supportive Leadership: )
/E (5\) Lack of Supportive Leadership: )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
431 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Lack of supportive leadership exacerbates employees' mental health issues by fostering feelings of disengagement and frustration. Without guidance or encouragement, employees may experience increased stress and anxiety. Supportive leaders who provide mentorship, recognition, and empathy create a positive work environment where employees feel valued and supported. Investing in leadership development and promoting emotional intelligence can help cultivate supportive leadership practices and enhance employee mental health.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
