<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A toxic or negative workplace culture characterized by gossip, favoritism, lack of trust, or poor interpersonal relationships can erode employee well-being and contribute to mental health issues.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [11]
>>
