442 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Jobs that require constant multitasking, high levels of concentration, or exposure to traumatic or distressing situations \(e.g., healthcare workers, emergency responders\) can increase the risk of mental health issues such as burnout, compassion fatigue, or PTSD.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [8]
>>
