445 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Stigma and discrimination surrounding mental health can deter employees from seeking help or sharing their struggles, worsening their condition. Fear of judgment and repercussions perpetuates distress, hindering recovery. Employers must combat stigma through education, support, and creating a safe environment for employees to address mental health concerns.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [9]
>>
