516 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (1\) Understand the Relationship: The primary objective is to understand the relationship between organizational factors and employee mental health. By examining various aspects of the work environment, such as culture, leadership, workload, and support systems, researchers aim to uncover how these factors influence employees' psychological well-being.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
