/Pg 25 0 R
>>
endobj
522 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (3\) Explore Protective Factors: In addition to identifying risk factors, researchers aim to explore organizational factors that may serve as protective factors for employee mental health. This involves identifying aspects of the work environment that promote resilience, coping mechanisms, social support, and overall well-being.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
