endobj
527 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (4\) Inform Intervention Strategies: A key objective is to inform the development of intervention strategies aimed at promoting employee mental health within organizations. By understanding how organizational factors impact mental health, researchers can provide insights into effective interventions, policies, and practices that support employee well-being.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
528 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 258 0 R
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
