/Pg 26 0 R
>>
endobj
530 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (5\) Enhance Organizational Performance: There is an objective to demonstrate the link between employee mental health and organizational performance. By promoting employee well-being, organizations can potentially improve productivity, reduce absenteeism and turnover, enhance job satisfaction, and foster a positive organizational culture.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [5 6]
>>
endobj
