>>
endobj
533 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (6\) Contribute to Policy Development: Researchers aim to contribute to the development of organizational policies and practices that prioritize employee mental health. This may involve advocating for changes in leadership approaches, workload management, communication strategies, and the provision of mental health support services.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K [7 8]
>>
endobj
